        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A super chaotic puzzle game of macho x agriculture! ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's raise various kinds of machos that are born by sowing protein in the field with care and love and ship them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The director of the macho farm loves muscles so much that he ends up opening a ``macho farm.''</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bury a mysterious seed called ``Macho Seed'' in the soil and feed it with protein instead of water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few days later, small dumbbell buds will appear, and the scent of muscles will fill the entire field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People from the next town say: &quot;Isn't there some kind of protein wind blowing?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grown machos work hard on squats and bench presses every day, Gradually, your pectoral muscles will grow and your abdominal muscles will start to crack...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Only 3 steps to ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >①Put protein in the field</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Macho will be born by sowing 3 types of proteins in the field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of macho colors can be created by combining colors...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >② Cultivate macho character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By giving more protein to the newly born macho, the level will increase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's grow it well and prepare for shipping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >③Shipping together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a high score by shipping many machos at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's grow muscle well according to the shape of protein!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A super chaotic puzzle game of macho x agriculture! ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's raise various kinds of machos that are born by sowing protein in the field with care and love and ship them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The director of the macho farm loves muscles so much that he ends up opening a ``macho farm.''</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bury a mysterious seed called ``Macho Seed'' in the soil and feed it with protein instead of water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few days later, small dumbbell buds will appear, and the scent of muscles will fill the entire field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People from the next town say: &quot;Isn't there some kind of protein wind blowing?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grown machos work hard on squats and bench presses every day, Gradually, your pectoral muscles will grow and your abdominal muscles will start to crack...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■Only 3 steps to ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >①Put protein in the field</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Macho will be born by sowing 3 types of proteins in the field!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of macho colors can be created by combining colors...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >② Cultivate macho character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By giving more protein to the newly born macho, the level will increase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's grow it well and prepare for shipping!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >③Shipping together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a high score by shipping many machos at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's grow muscle well according to the shape of protein!</p>",
        "short_description": "A super chaotic puzzle game of macho x agriculture! ? Let's raise various kinds of machos that are born by sowing protein in the field with care and love and ship them!",
